ic  amount of time to lay out exactly why  that is because i don't believe in  saying that you just don't like  something without being able to back it  up even if it is an incredibly minor  feature in fact especially if it's a  minor feature with all of that said i'm  still very excited for more jujut's kai  kaisen in particular i'm very keen to  know more about hakari and discover his  cursed technique and very eager to  understand the kind of madness he's  capable of that causes him to generate  solid respect from characters such as  yuta and gojo and if you'd like to earn  gojo's respect then do go and check out  this video it's filled with lots of  cursey goodness because there's always  more to learn explore and experience  with this wonderful series so i look  forward to seeing you there

